#: ../../source/export.rst:2 e5b0f8fca5e8419ca2aa32b326c76c15
msgid "导出说明"
msgstr "Exporting projects"

#: ../../source/export.rst:4 5c8c292a2550452eb3e5b95da73e7595
msgid ""
"导出项目需同时包含完整插件、目标平台的 GDExtension 二进制、FMOD 运行库和音频资源。环境要求为 Godot 4.7.2 或更新版本及匹配的 FMOD Core SDK "
"2.04；安装步骤见 :doc:`getting_started/installation`。"
msgstr ""
"An exported project needs the complete addon, the target-platform GDExtension binary, the FMOD "
"runtime, and its audio resources. Use Godot 4.7.2 or later and matching FMOD Core SDK 2.04 "
"libraries. See :doc:`getting_started/installation` for setup."

#: ../../source/export.rst:7 49566a40726448e1a1dc65fe3b580737
msgid "导出前检查"
msgstr "Before exporting"

#: ../../source/export.rst:9 e7df29200c57424082143d0dd13f01ed
msgid ""
"当前提供 Windows x86_64、Linux x86_64 和 Android arm64 配置。其他 Android ABI 可自行构建；macOS / iOS 为实验性支持，需自行配置"
" SDK、链接项与扩展库条目。平台状态见 :ref:`platform-support`。"
msgstr ""
"Configuration is provided for Windows x86_64, Linux x86_64, and Android arm64. Other Android ABIs"
" can be built locally. macOS / iOS support is experimental and requires local SDK, linking, and "
"extension-library setup. See :ref:`platform-support` for platform status."

#: ../../source/export.rst:11 65d6396f2546479baac29034d2945864
msgid ""
"复制完整的 ``addons/fmod_player``，保留 "
"``fmod_check.gd``、``fmod_player_main.gd``、导入器、翻译、图标及原生库。扩展配置的版本、库名和依赖应与当前插件一致："
msgstr ""
"Copy the complete ``addons/fmod_player`` directory, keeping ``fmod_check.gd``, "
"``fmod_player_main.gd``, importers, translations, icons, and native libraries. Keep the extension"
" configuration's version, library names, and dependencies aligned with the current plugin:"

#: ../../source/export.rst:13 a2346903dbe24cc4b376a817ed8e31cf
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[configuration]\n"
"entry_symbol = \"fmod_player_init\"\n"
"compatibility_minimum = \"4.7.2\"\n"
"reloadable = false\n"
"\n"
"[libraries]\n"
"windows.debug.x86_64 = \"fmod_player.windows.template_debug.x86_64.dll\"\n"
"windows.release.x86_64 = \"fmod_player.windows.template_release.x86_64.dll\"\n"
"linux.debug.x86_64 = \"libfmod_player.linux.template_debug.x86_64.so\"\n"
"linux.release.x86_64 = \"libfmod_player.linux.template_release.x86_64.so\"\n"
"android.debug.arm64 = \"libfmod_player.android.template_debug.arm64.so\"\n"
"android.release.arm64 = \"libfmod_player.android.template_release.arm64.so\"\n"
"\n"
"[dependencies]\n"
"windows.debug.x86_64 = { \"fmod.dll\" : \"\" }\n"
"windows.release.x86_64 = { \"fmod.dll\" : \"\" }\n"
"linux.debug.x86_64 = { \"libfmodL.so.15\" : \"\" }\n"
"linux.release.x86_64 = { \"libfmod.so.15\" : \"\" }"
msgstr ""
"[configuration]\n"
"entry_symbol = \"fmod_player_init\"\n"
"compatibility_minimum = \"4.7.2\"\n"
"reloadable = false\n"
"\n"
"[libraries]\n"
"windows.debug.x86_64 = \"fmod_player.windows.template_debug.x86_64.dll\"\n"
"windows.release.x86_64 = \"fmod_player.windows.template_release.x86_64.dll\"\n"
"linux.debug.x86_64 = \"libfmod_player.linux.template_debug.x86_64.so\"\n"
"linux.release.x86_64 = \"libfmod_player.linux.template_release.x86_64.so\"\n"
"android.debug.arm64 = \"libfmod_player.android.template_debug.arm64.so\"\n"
"android.release.arm64 = \"libfmod_player.android.template_release.arm64.so\"\n"
"\n"
"[dependencies]\n"
"windows.debug.x86_64 = { \"fmod.dll\" : \"\" }\n"
"windows.release.x86_64 = { \"fmod.dll\" : \"\" }\n"
"linux.debug.x86_64 = { \"libfmodL.so.15\" : \"\" }\n"
"linux.release.x86_64 = { \"libfmod.so.15\" : \"\" }"

#: ../../source/export.rst:34 675ad874bfd74cf5b9d4b6829ae64a10
msgid ""
"``template_debug`` 对应编辑器和调试导出，``template_release`` 对应发布导出。当前插件关闭原生库热重载，替换库文件前关闭使用它的 Godot "
"项目，再重新打开。"
msgstr ""
"``template_debug`` is used by the editor and debug exports; ``template_release`` is used by "
"release exports. Native-library hot reload is disabled in the current plugin. Close Godot "
"projects using a library before replacing it, then reopen them."

#: ../../source/export.rst:37 0d87cd16a53b4423a492a840455c8bd1
msgid "资源与导出预设"
msgstr "Resources and export presets"

#: ../../source/export.rst:39 9f2a887f620a4370b7445dfe65d05304
msgid "在 **项目 > 导出** 中选择目标平台，并确认其架构与扩展及 FMOD 运行库一致。"
msgstr ""
"Select the target platform under **Project > Export** and ensure its architecture matches the "
"extension and FMOD runtime."

#: ../../source/export.rst:40 40f8724aedfc4c2d8d85660e33c5b80b
msgid "使用资源引用保存已导入音频。通过 FileAccess 动态读取原始文件时，将文件加入导出规则。"
msgstr ""
"Keep imported audio through resource references. Include raw files in export rules when reading "
"them dynamically with FileAccess."

#: ../../source/export.rst:41 7667b20cbbaa4e4ab15ef7bf61c0049f
msgid "仅导出选定场景时，在资源包含过滤器中加入 ``*.gdextension``，使 Godot 的原生扩展导出器处理扩展和依赖。"
msgstr ""
"When exporting selected scenes only, add ``*.gdextension`` to the resource include filter so "
"Godot's native extension exporter handles the extension and its dependencies."

#: ../../source/export.rst:42 f90854d527764527ba30f7b1289c7db3
msgid "独立 FMOD 总线的默认布局及其资源依赖由插件的导出集成包含。布局设置与保存方式见 :doc:`user_guide/mixer`。"
msgstr ""
"The plugin's export integration includes the independent FMOD default bus layout and its resource"
" dependencies. See :doc:`user_guide/mixer` for layout settings and saving."

#: ../../source/export.rst:45 be414e15bfcf46f382ccb6a46951d3e3
msgid "Windows 导出"
msgstr "Windows export"

#: ../../source/export.rst:47 56aad87e86f4467e9e38e7e4b9ce8e03
msgid ""
"Windows x86_64 的 Debug 和 Release 均使用 ``fmod.dll``。把 Windows SDK 的运行库放在 "
"``addons/fmod_player/bin``，并保留当前目标的扩展 DLL。发布导出选择 "
"``fmod_player.windows.template_release.x86_64.dll``。"
msgstr ""
"Both Debug and Release on Windows x86_64 use ``fmod.dll``. Place the Windows SDK runtime in "
"``addons/fmod_player/bin`` and retain the extension DLL for the selected target. Release exports "
"use ``fmod_player.windows.template_release.x86_64.dll``."

#: ../../source/export.rst:49 8572fe9d614c4a919f282419b5f2b732
msgid "先导出到空目录，再运行导出的可执行文件，确认无 GDExtension 或 FMOD 依赖加载错误，并测试播放和停止。"
msgstr ""
"Export to an empty directory first, then run the exported executable. Check for GDExtension or "
"FMOD dependency-loading errors and test playback and stopping."

#: ../../source/export.rst:52 be414e15bfcf46f382ccb6a46951d3e3
msgid "Linux 导出"
msgstr "Linux export"

#: ../../source/export.rst:57 dc6b78fa7d9046bab3622e8ca9375c43
msgid "导出类型"
msgstr "Export type"

#: ../../source/export.rst:58 6ae167283d244e3fb8d334fb01e029da
msgid "扩展库"
msgstr "Extension library"

#: ../../source/export.rst:59 7048dc4873ee4de6b4dc964d7ad2b1e5
msgid "FMOD 依赖"
msgstr "FMOD dependency"

#: ../../source/export.rst:60 a524312fd1d54018b063f62fd61b9df6
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Debug"

#: ../../source/export.rst:61 e372c66671d9446ca852761a2a9851ac
msgid "``libfmod_player.linux.template_debug.x86_64.so``"
msgstr "``libfmod_player.linux.template_debug.x86_64.so``"

#: ../../source/export.rst:62 9e218efde7334309baf3209254947231
msgid "``libfmodL.so.15``"
msgstr "``libfmodL.so.15``"

#: ../../source/export.rst:63 a088274a0f2f4395a66e97c070b7fd17
msgid "Release"
msgstr "Release"

#: ../../source/export.rst:64 e372c66671d9446ca852761a2a9851ac
msgid "``libfmod_player.linux.template_release.x86_64.so``"
msgstr "``libfmod_player.linux.template_release.x86_64.so``"

#: ../../source/export.rst:65 9e218efde7334309baf3209254947231
msgid "``libfmod.so.15``"
msgstr "``libfmod.so.15``"

#: ../../source/export.rst:67 130231f2942444899959d308a164e290
msgid ""
"使用 FMOD Linux Core SDK 的对应运行库，放在扩展库旁。保留版本化共享库及其符号链接，或把链接目标复制为上表中的文件名。扩展通过 ``$ORIGIN`` "
"查找同目录运行库；复制导出结果时保留原生库目录结构。"
msgstr ""
"Place the matching FMOD Linux Core SDK runtime beside the extension. Keep the versioned shared "
"library and its symlinks, or copy the symlink target using the filename shown above. The "
"extension uses ``$ORIGIN`` to locate adjacent runtimes. Preserve the native-library directory "
"structure when copying the export."

#: ../../source/export.rst:69 37ecec74cf844968b24e81c22933b3ed
msgid "Linux x86_64 已在 Ubuntu 26.04 测试。仍需在目标发行版运行导出项目，检查系统依赖、播放、总线路由及效果器。"
msgstr ""
"Linux x86_64 has been tested on Ubuntu 26.04. Run the export on the target distribution to check "
"system dependencies, playback, bus routing, and effects."

#: ../../source/export.rst:72 783e45b7494a4341a9c9b16f2731e6ec
msgid "Android 导出"
msgstr "Android export"

#: ../../source/export.rst:74 127f35cd289d4869b3e4138cdfbcbb13
msgid ""
"Android 需要匹配 ABI 的插件库、FMOD 原生运行库和 ``fmod.jar``。本页使用 ``arm64-v8a``；Debug/dev 使用 "
"``libfmodL.so``，Release 使用 ``libfmod.so``。"
msgstr ""
"Android requires the plugin library, FMOD native runtime, and ``fmod.jar`` for the same ABI. This"
" page uses ``arm64-v8a``. Debug/dev builds use ``libfmodL.so``; Release builds use "
"``libfmod.so``."

#: ../../source/export.rst:77 8fa0fffbbc2f4683992fd57f755fbff9
msgid "使用配置工具"
msgstr "Use the configuration tool"

#: ../../source/export.rst:79 53c1c797ae4c45f6824ad9c1b1eb7ac5
msgid "先通过 **项目 > 安装 Android 构建模板** 安装与当前 Godot 版本匹配的模板。工具要求项目中已经存在 ``android/build``，不会自动安装模板。"
msgstr ""
"First install the build template matching your Godot version through **Project > Install Android "
"Build Template**. The tool requires an existing ``android/build`` directory and does not install "
"the template automatically."

#: ../../source/export.rst:84 031b92650bac4788b3fc6a03c5d5425a
msgid ""
"打开 **项目 > 工具 > Configure FMOD Android Export**，选择 FMOD Android SDK 目录，或下载的 ``.tar.gz`` / ``.tgz``"
" 包。"
msgstr ""
"Open **Project > Tools > Configure FMOD Android Export** and select the FMOD Android SDK "
"directory or its downloaded ``.tar.gz`` / ``.tgz`` archive."

#: ../../source/export.rst:85 8bb3e7f2f194479a82a9e0fe01a8611c
msgid "点击 **Review Changes**，核对运行库复制位置及 ``gradle.properties``、``build.gradle`` 和 ``GodotApp.java`` 的修改。"
msgstr ""
"Click **Review Changes** and review the runtime destinations and edits to ``gradle.properties``, "
"``build.gradle``, and ``GodotApp.java``."

#: ../../source/export.rst:86 ea38037bd84e4c84bdd9d4135730ead3
msgid ""
"点击 **Apply Changes** 应用修改。工具会加入 ``fmod.jar`` 依赖，并让 Debug/dev 加载 ``fmodL``、Release 加载 ``fmod``，在 "
"Godot 启动前完成加载。"
msgstr ""
"Click **Apply Changes**. The tool adds the ``fmod.jar`` dependency and loads ``fmodL`` for "
"Debug/dev or ``fmod`` for Release before Godot starts."

#: ../../source/export.rst:88 e17d309f9bdb4968b2a8643ef04258ea
msgid ""
"工具仅复制已有的 arm64 插件二进制，不会编译缺失的扩展库。查看完成报告中的跳过或失败项目；更换二进制后需重新同步到构建模板。已有自定义 Gradle 或 Java "
"修改时，也应先复核变更内容。"
msgstr ""
"The tool only copies existing arm64 plugin binaries; it does not compile missing extension "
"libraries. Check the completion report for skipped or failed steps, and resynchronize the build "
"template after replacing binaries. Review changes carefully when Gradle or Java files already "
"contain custom edits."

#: ../../source/export.rst:91 34ee75ecfd2c413da30b28ffea999a23
msgid "手动维护自定义模板"
msgstr "Maintain a custom template manually"

#: ../../source/export.rst:93 194cc1feb9dc4fcb9b7662e32ce7ed60
msgid "如果自行维护构建模板，需保留以下对应关系。FMOD 文件取自同一 Android SDK，插件库来自相应的 SCons 构建目标："
msgstr ""
"If you maintain the build template yourself, preserve the following mapping. Use FMOD files from "
"one Android SDK release and plugin libraries from the corresponding SCons targets:"

#: ../../source/export.rst:95 0182a2a6f9df4d08839d07e2dd7f2102
msgid ""
"android/build/libs/\n"
"├── fmod.jar\n"
"├── debug/arm64-v8a/\n"
"│   ├── libfmodL.so\n"
"│   └── libfmod_player.android.template_debug.arm64.so\n"
"├── dev/arm64-v8a/\n"
"│   ├── libfmodL.so\n"
"│   └── libfmod_player.android.template_debug.arm64.so\n"
"└── release/arm64-v8a/\n"
"    ├── libfmod.so\n"
"    └── libfmod_player.android.template_release.arm64.so"
msgstr ""
"android/build/libs/\n"
"├── fmod.jar\n"
"├── debug/arm64-v8a/\n"
"│   ├── libfmodL.so\n"
"│   └── libfmod_player.android.template_debug.arm64.so\n"
"├── dev/arm64-v8a/\n"
"│   ├── libfmodL.so\n"
"│   └── libfmod_player.android.template_debug.arm64.so\n"
"└── release/arm64-v8a/\n"
"    ├── libfmod.so\n"
"    └── libfmod_player.android.template_release.arm64.so"

#: ../../source/export.rst:109 8866c874fd9446279ca0b43fa34e77dd
msgid "在 ``android/build/build.gradle`` 的 ``dependencies`` 中加入："
msgstr "Add this dependency to ``android/build/build.gradle``:"

#: ../../source/export.rst:111 5c2e0a7ccbbf48baa509ac4ff04f6e3d
msgid "implementation files(\"libs/fmod.jar\")"
msgstr "implementation files(\"libs/fmod.jar\")"

#: ../../source/export.rst:115 2db5208d8a434cd4a17be33bee6c9938
msgid "在 ``GodotApp.java`` 的 ``onCreate`` 中、``super.onCreate`` 之前按构建类型加载对应运行库，与配置工具的行为一致："
msgstr ""
"In ``GodotApp.java``, load the matching runtime in ``onCreate`` before ``super.onCreate``, as the"
" configuration tool does:"

#: ../../source/export.rst:117 b8a8678ab60544cb81c0688796cd1e44
msgid ""
"@Override\n"
"public void onCreate(Bundle savedInstanceState) {\n"
"    if (BuildConfig.DEBUG) {\n"
"        System.loadLibrary(\"fmodL\");\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        System.loadLibrary(\"fmod\");\n"
"    }\n"
"    super.onCreate(savedInstanceState);\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"@Override\n"
"public void onCreate(Bundle savedInstanceState) {\n"
"    if (BuildConfig.DEBUG) {\n"
"        System.loadLibrary(\"fmodL\");\n"
"    } else {\n"
"        System.loadLibrary(\"fmod\");\n"
"    }\n"
"    super.onCreate(savedInstanceState);\n"
"}"

#: ../../source/export.rst:129 3b5d6439c8784531b57d0f2a0c406f6c
msgid ""
"其他 ABI 需要自行构建对应插件库，检查 ``fmod_player.gdextension``、模板目录与导出预设三者一致。不要把 Windows 或 Linux SDK 的运行库复制到 "
"Android 模板。"
msgstr ""
"For other ABIs, build matching plugin libraries and align ``fmod_player.gdextension``, template "
"directories, and export presets. Do not copy Windows or Linux SDK runtimes into an Android "
"template."

#: ../../source/export.rst:134 d3bef44ef8aa49e5ab18e1b1e7b0f075
msgid "导出设置"
msgstr "Export settings"

#: ../../source/export.rst:136 2a7d7ba6ea584761ae224511abae3d8a
msgid "在 Android 导出预设中选择 ``arm64-v8a`` 并启用 Gradle 构建。"
msgstr "Select ``arm64-v8a`` and enable Gradle builds in the Android export preset."

#: ../../source/export.rst:137 abf6ce35eb9b4a078178e63cb1dad00b
msgid "导出 APK 或 AAB，在真机检查启动、播放、停止、总线效果和空间音频。"
msgstr ""
"Export an APK or AAB, then test startup, playback, stopping, bus effects, and spatial audio on a "
"physical device."

#: ../../source/export.rst:143 9a3d6dea91ac4766a0c81ea1f48608d9
msgid "源码构建发布库"
msgstr "Build release libraries"

#: ../../source/export.rst:145 a26b22b4ef6f4113b85de56e15767bdf
msgid "修改 C++ 后，在插件仓库中为目标平台构建发布库。SDK 路径和 Android NDK 版本配置见 :doc:`contributing/development`。"
msgstr ""
"After C++ changes, build a release library for the target platform from the plugin repository. "
"See :doc:`contributing/development` for SDK paths and Android NDK configuration."

#: ../../source/export.rst:147 567262d8115546b2b0faf399aa46a943
msgid ""
"scons platform=windows target=template_release arch=x86_64\n"
"scons platform=linux target=template_release arch=x86_64\n"
"scons platform=android target=template_release arch=arm64"
msgstr ""
"scons platform=windows target=template_release arch=x86_64\n"
"scons platform=linux target=template_release arch=x86_64\n"
"scons platform=android target=template_release arch=arm64"

#: ../../source/export.rst:153 9043a3a3807a4253b4c215b6f0144fce
msgid "构建直接输出到插件仓库的 ``addons/fmod_player/bin``。将完整插件更新到实际游戏项目；Android 还需更新构建模板内已复制的扩展库。"
msgstr ""
"Builds write directly to ``addons/fmod_player/bin`` in the plugin repository. Update the complete"
" addon in the game project; for Android, also update extension libraries copied into the build "
"template."

#: ../../source/export.rst:156 1074517038ad49a596a9cbaf7607031d
msgid "验证与排错"
msgstr "Validate and troubleshoot"

#: ../../source/export.rst:158 b940104956854776a663e4ba3e538863
msgid "发布前先按 :doc:`contributing/testing` 打开测试项目、按 F5 试听并运行 8 项数值回归。然后在实际目标设备上验证导出结果，不能用编辑器测试代替平台导出验证。"
msgstr ""
"Before release, follow :doc:`contributing/testing` to open the test project, press F5, listen, "
"and run the eight numerical checks. Then validate the exported game on the actual target device; "
"editor tests do not replace platform export checks."

#: ../../source/export.rst:160 7eeaa5a66e504958ad1a79de88b3dbea
msgid "加载失败：确认 Godot 不低于 4.7.2，扩展库与 FMOD 运行库的版本、架构和 Debug/Release 目标匹配。"
msgstr ""
"Loading failure: use Godot 4.7.2 or later and match the extension and FMOD runtime versions, "
"architecture, and Debug/Release target."

#: ../../source/export.rst:161 4b2e7c07110545b2b82566c8ca3b7291
msgid "Linux 找不到运行库：检查扩展旁的 ``libfmodL.so.15`` 或 ``libfmod.so.15``，以及符号链接目标和系统依赖。"
msgstr ""
"Linux runtime not found: check ``libfmodL.so.15`` or ``libfmod.so.15`` beside the extension, "
"including symlink targets and system dependencies."

#: ../../source/export.rst:162 271d7ac1224943a2933709efa9cf21c5
msgid ""
"Android 启动崩溃：检查 APK/AAB 的 ABI、Debug/dev 的 ``libfmodL.so`` 或 Release 的 ``libfmod.so``、``fmod.jar``"
" 及 Java 加载分支，并查看 Logcat。"
msgstr ""
"Android startup crash: check the APK/AAB ABI, ``libfmodL.so`` for Debug/dev or ``libfmod.so`` for"
" Release, ``fmod.jar``, and the Java loading branch, then inspect Logcat."

#: ../../source/export.rst:163 bd55534ce18640feb27e679ac470d914
msgid "只有导出后无声：检查音频资源、原始文件过滤和独立总线默认布局是否包含，参见 :ref:`faq-export-audio-missing`。"
msgstr ""
"Audio missing only after export: check inclusion of audio resources, raw-file filters, and the "
"independent default bus layout. See :ref:`faq-export-audio-missing`."

#: ../../source/export.rst:166 07c9c5cd41c0499ebae01080d58664dc
msgid "许可与署名"
msgstr "Licensing and attribution"

